/course/2026/INFT2031">Systems and Network Administration</a> (Newcastle)</li><li><strong>SENG1050</strong> <a href="https://handbook.newcastle.edu.au/course/2026/SENG1050">Web Technologies</a> (Newcastle, Singapore)</li></ul><p><strong>Course List </strong>To fulfil the requirements for a first teaching area, complete 30 units from the following list (with a minimum of 20 units at the 3000 level).</p><ul><li><strong>CMNS2016</strong> <a href="https://handbook.newcastle.edu.au/course/2026/CMNS2016">Interactive Storytelling</a> (Singapore)</li><li><strong>COMP3350</strong> <a href="https://handbook.newcastle.edu.au/course/2026/COMP3350">Advanced Database</a> (Newcastle)</li><li><strong>EBUS3050</strong> <a href="https://handbook.newcastle.edu.au/course/2026/EBUS3050">Systems Design for the Digital Economy</a> (Newcastle, Singapore)</li><li><strong>INFT3100</strong> <a href="https://handbook.newcastle.edu.au/course/2026/INFT3100">ICT Project Management</a> (Newcastle, Singapore)</li><li><strong>SENG2130</strong> <a href="https://handbook.newcastle.edu.au/course/2026/SENG2130">Systems Analysis and Design</a> (Newcastle, Singapore)</li></ul><p>These are courses currently available in <em>"Information Processes and Technology"</em>, there may be additional courses available in future terms. For full requirements and course availability always refer to the <a href="https://handbook.newcastle.edu.au/program/2026/50091">handbook</a>.</p><p><a href="#">Japanese</a></p><p><strong>Compulsory </strong>To fulfil the compulsory course requirements for a first teaching area, complete the courses listed below.</p><ul><li><strong>EDUC2143</strong> <a href="https://handbook.newcastle.edu.au/course/2026/EDUC2143">Junior Languages Curriculum Methods</a> (Newcastle)</li><li><strong>EDUC4143</strong> <a href="https://handbook.newcastle.edu.au/course/2026/EDUC4143">Senior Languages Curriculum Methods</a> (Newcastle)</li></ul><p><strong>Course List </strong>To fulfil the course list requir