ersity to avoid delays with your application.</p> <ul> <li><a href="https://www.newcastle.edu.au/study/international/the-university-in-your-country">Find an education agent in your country</a></li> </ul> <p>Once you have started your application you will be provided with a reference number. You or your education agent will be able to track your application as it progresses.</p> <p><a href="https://www.newcastle.edu.au/study/international/admissions?ctx_prg=40367">Apply online</a></p> Similar degrees <a href="bachelor-of-mechanical-engineering-honours">Bachelor of Mechanical Engineering (Honours)<ul><li><strong>Selection Rank:</strong> 77.00 (Newcastle)</li><li><strong>Indicative Fee1:</strong> AUD 46,380</li><li><strong>Full-time duration:</strong> 4 years</li><li><strong>Part-time duration:</strong> up to 10 years</li><li><strong>Locations:</strong> PSB Singapore, Newcastle</li></ul><p>Learn more</p></a> <a href="bachelor-of-aerospace-systems-engineering-honours">Bachelor of Aerospace Systems Engineering (Honours)<ul><li><strong>Selection Rank:</strong> 77.00 (Newcastle)</li><li><strong>Indicative Fee1:</strong> undefined</li><li><strong>Full-time duration:</strong> 4 years</li><li><strong>Part-time duration:</strong> up to 10 years</li><li><strong>Locations:</strong> Newcastle</li></ul><p>Learn more</p></a> <a href="bachelor-of-electrical-and-electronic-engineering-honours">Bachelor of Electrical and Electronic Engineering (Honours)<ul><li><strong>Selection Rank:</strong> 77.00 (Newcastle)</li><li><strong>Indicative Fee1:</strong> AUD 46,575</li><li><strong>Full-time duration:</strong> 4 years</li><li><strong>Part-time duration:</strong> up to 10 years</li><li><strong>Locations:</strong> Newcastle</li></ul><p>Learn more</p></a> <p>1 Indicative annual fees are based on a full year full time load (80 units). <a href="https://www.newcastle.edu.au/current-students/study-essentials/fees-scholarships/types-of-tuition-fees">Learn more.</a></p> <p> <a href="combined">View