    course_description = '<h4>Degree overview</h4><p>Bridge Finance and Innovation</p><p>The Graduate Certificate in Fintech equips students with fundamental financial knowledge, analytical skills and digital capabilities to navigate the rapidly evolving finance landscape. This program provides a unique nexus between traditional financial knowledge and transformative digital technologies.</p> <p> <strong> AACSB &amp; EQUIS ? </strong> accredited business school <!-- no link --> </p> <p> <strong> World top 175 ? </strong> for business and economics </p> <p> <strong> Top 1% ? </strong> university in the world <!-- no link --> </p> <h4>Career opportunities</h4><p>This program provides graduates with fundamental financial knowledge and practical skills to operate in the financial services sector.</p> <p><strong>On completion, you’ll be able to work in roles such as:</strong></p><ul><li>Financial Manager</li><li>Financial Analyst</li><li>Business Analyst</li><li>Portfolio Manager</li><li>Investment Banker</li><li>Business Consultant</li><li>Corporate Treasurer</li><li>Financial Regulator</li><li>Compliant Expert.</li></ul> <p>94.7% employed within four months of graduating.</p> <p>Graduate Outcomes Survey (2022-2024) - Postgraduate Business and Management</p>',
