    course_description = '<h4>Degree overview</h4><p>Build Practical Skills in Sports Data Analysis</p><p>This program will provide you with the skills and knowledge essential to measuring and evaluating sport performance through data analysis. By focusing on practical applications and case studies from the sports industry, you will learn how to effectively and ethically use data to make informed decisions.</p> <p> <strong> 94.7% employed ? </strong> after graduating </p> <p> <strong> World top 175 ? </strong> for business and economics </p> <h4>Career opportunities</h4><p>On completion of this degree, you’ll be able to work in roles that span across various major sporting organisations and the global sports industry including:</p><ul><li>Sports Business Analytics</li><li>Performance Analytics.</li></ul> <p>27.3% projected employment growth by 2030.</p> <p>The Business Research Company</p>',
