UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Degree overview</h4><p>Become a dynamic leader in the Global Business Economy</p><p>Around the world, data analytics is increasingly used to inform and drive business decisions at an operational and strategic level. Study a combined Master of Business Administration (Global) / Master of Science (Data Analytics) and gain two master’s degrees in two years.</p> <p>Learn how to model real-world scenarios and gain advanced skills in data manipulation, analysis, and interpretation. Apply analytics on big data from diverse business processes across various industries. Connect with our business industry networks and deepen your understanding of how globalisation influences stakeholders, societies, and economies.</p> <p> <strong> World top 150 ? </strong> for Business Administration </p> <p> <strong> 94.7% employed ? </strong> after graduating </p> <h4>Career opportunities</h4><p>This combined degree will provide you with a diverse skillset. It will allow you to work globally in many different industries.</p> <p><strong>Possible career paths may include:</strong></p><ul><li>Global Management Consultant</li><li>Multinational Marketing Manager</li><li>International Trade Policy Advisor</li><li>Global Supply Chain Manager</li><li>Data Manager</li><li>Data Analyst</li><li>Business Intelligence Analyst</li><li>Data and Insights Expert</li><li>Global Entrepreneur</li><li>Public Accounting Consultant.</li></ul>',
