UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Degree overview</h4><p>Enhance your understanding of International Business</p><p>Are you looking to deepen your understanding of international business and propel your career to new heights? Our comprehensive program focuses on developing your strategic decision-making knowledge and further skills required to be a successful manager for organisations with an international focus. These skills will prepare you to form and implement strategic decisions that operate in the global business environment.</p> <p>Our program is hosted at NUspace, in the heart of Newcastle''s CBD, and offers International Study immersion opportunities. Flexible study options are available to help you study at a pace that suits you. You may also be able to gain credit for your work experience to fast-track completion of your studies.</p> <p> <strong> World top 150 ? </strong> for Business Administration </p> <p> <strong> World top 175 ? </strong> for business and economics </p> <h4>Career opportunities</h4><p>You will learn the complex dynamics of multinational firms and the global economic environment in which they operate. You will be able to conduct strategic analysis of business opportunities in an international context. You will also be able to comprehend how national and international economic, political, legal and commercial organisations and institutions impact upon multinational and domestic enterprises.</p><p>Our comprehensive approach to the study of international business ensures that you can aspire to careers in wide variety of organisations. These include:</p><ul><li>Multinational firms</li><li>Domestic firms</li><li>Non-government and not-for-profit organisations</li><li>Educational institutes and international bodies, such as the World Bank and UN.</li></ul> <ul></ul><p><strong>On completion, you’ll be able to work in roles such as:</strong></p><ul><li>Global Business Consultant</li><li>Global Business Development Manager</li><li>International Trade Specialist</li><li>Entrepreneur</li><li>International Finance Advisor</li><li>Industry Specialist Manager.</li></ul>',
    course_duration_per_week = 78,
    offshore_tuition_fee = 69727,
    onshore_tuition_fee = NULL,
