    course_description = '<h4>Degree overview</h4><p>Business Leadership Meets Marketing Innovation</p><p>This combined program allows students to broaden their business expertise while gaining specialist skills in marketing and digital strategy. Students will develop high-level leadership, strategic and analytical capabilities through the MBA, alongside targeted knowledge in marketing, branding, digital platforms and consumer engagement.</p> <p>Ideal for aspiring managers and marketing professionals, the program blends core business foundations with cutting-edge digital marketing strategies—preparing graduates to lead, innovate and succeed in a rapidly evolving global business landscape.</p> <p> <strong> AACSB &amp; EQUIS ? </strong> accredited business school <!-- no link --> </p> <p> <strong> World top 175 ? </strong> for business and economics </p> <h4>Career opportunities</h4><p>Career opportunities in Marketing exist across all industries. Roles can span areas such as marketing strategy and planning, brand management, marketing communications, marketing research, social marketing, digital marketing and sustainability.</p> <p>The skills and knowledge you will gain in this program underpin many senior roles including:</p><ul><li>Marketing Manager</li><li>Strategic Planning Manager</li><li>Business Management Consultant</li><li>Marketing Communications Director</li><li>Business Development Director.</li></ul> <p>94.7% employed within four months of graduating.</p> <p>Graduate Outcomes Survey (2022-2024) - Postgraduate Business &amp; Management</p>',
