UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Degree overview</h4><p>Lead the Digital Finance Revolution </p><p>This program is designed to meet the rising global demand for professionals equipped to lead in the fast-moving FinTech sector. This future-focused degree integrates business, finance, and technology to prepare graduates for roles in digital banking, blockchain, cybersecurity, and data-driven finance.</p> <p>Whether you''re aiming to advance your career, deepen your expertise, or expand your global employability, the Master of FinTech (Advanced) offers the skills, knowledge, and regional relevance to succeed in the digital economy.</p> <p> <strong> AACSB &amp; EQUIS ? </strong> accredited business school <!-- no link --> </p> <p> <strong> World top 175 ? </strong> for business and economics </p> <p> <strong> Top 1% ? </strong> university in the world <!-- no link --> </p> <h4>Career opportunities</h4><p>This program empowers graduates with cutting-edge financial technology expertise, enabling them to harness digital transformation, leverage data-driven insights, and champion ethical, corporate, and socially responsible practices. It also provides specialised financial knowledge and practical skills essential for success in the financial services sector. These capabilities can significantly enhance your value in the workplace—accelerating your path to senior roles, boosting your earning potential, and advancing your career.</p> <p><strong>On completion, you’ll be able to work in roles such as:</strong></p><ul><li>Financial Manager</li><li>Financial Analyst</li><li>Business Analyst</li><li>Portfolio Manager</li><li>Investment Banker</li><li>Business Consultant</li><li>Corporate Treasurer</li><li>Financial Regulator</li><li>Compliant Expert</li><li>Blockchain Developer</li><li>Financial Engineer</li><li>Decentralised Finance Developer</li><li>Innovation and Research Manager.</li></ul> <p>94.7% employed within four months of graduating.</p> <p>Graduate Outcomes Survey (2022-2024) - Postgraduate Business &amp; Management</p>',
