UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Degree overview</h4><p>Become a global leader and transform health care systems</p><p>This program responds to the growing transformations of global healthcare sectors. It will foster new skills for those already employed within the health sector, and prepare those yet to enter.</p><p>Learn directly from international leaders and industry experts. Gain knowledge and strategies to design, pitch and implement evidence-based solutions. Bring about transformative systems and organisational change through leadership and management roles.</p> <p>Developed by industry leaders, this program places you at the forefront of the unprecedented transformation in healthcare. It will give you the skills to govern and lead change among national and international stakeholders to improve healthcare outcomes.</p><p>Study at a time and pace that works for you, with our flexible and online learning options. Become an expert in the health sector, and lead change. A Graduate Certificate in Health Management and Policy is also available to study and can be used as a pathway into the masters program.</p> <p> <strong> AACSB &amp; EQUIS ? </strong> accredited business school <!-- no link --> </p> <p> <strong> World top 175 ? </strong> for business and economics </p> <h4>Career opportunities</h4><p>Career opportunities in healthcare span the globe. Work in health, policy or research.</p> <p>The skills and knowledge you will gain in this program underpin many senior roles including:</p><ul><li>Chief Health Policy Officer</li><li>Health Policy/Systems Analyst</li><li>Health and Outcome Research Analyst</li><li>Market Access and Government Affairs</li><li>Health Program and Services Manager/Director</li><li>Health Policy/Services Researcher.</li><li>Health Economist</li></ul>',
