UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Degree overview</h4><p>Advance Your Career in Sports Business and Analytics</p><p>The program combines the development of problem-solving skills, ethical and evidence-based decision-making, evidence-based decision-making and advanced research skills and strategic perspectives so that graduates are well-prepared for diverse careers in sport business and analytics.</p> <p>Delivered on-campus in Sydney, utilising the brand new Allianz Stadium and iconic Sydney Cricket Ground, this pioneering combined master’s degree covers contemporary global sports management and analytics subjects.</p> <p> <strong> 94.7% employed ? </strong> after graduating </p> <p> <strong> World top 175 ? </strong> for business and economics </p> <h4>Career opportunities</h4><p>On completion of this degree, you’ll be able to work in roles that span across various major sporting organisations and the global sports industry including Sports Business and Performance Analytics.</p> <p>Additionally this degree offers leadership and specialist roles across various sectors of the global sports industry.</p><p><strong>Leadership positions within:</strong></p><ul><li>Clubs</li><li>Governing Bodies</li><li>Organisations associated with sport.</li></ul><p><strong>Specialist roles within key business functions such as:</strong></p><ul><li>Commercial</li><li>Sponsorship</li><li>Marketing and Media</li><li>Operations.</li></ul> <p>27.3% projected employment growth by 2030.</p> <p>The Business Research Company</p>',
