    course_description = '<h4>Degree overview</h4><p>Master of Analytics for Performance and Business</p><p>This program is delivered in partnership with the Global Institute of Sport (GIS). This program is a future-focused sports analytics degree. It is designed for data-driven students with aspirations towards successful careers in sports business or performance analysis. Both of these growth areas require evidence-based decision making and research skills. These are fundamental learning outcomes of this degree.</p> <p>You will learn at the heart of Sydney’s business and sports districts. This will be supported by regular sessions at Allianz Stadium and Sydney Cricket Ground.</p> <p> <strong> 94.7% employed ? </strong> after graduating </p> <p> <strong> World top 175 ? </strong> for business and economics </p> <h4>Career opportunities</h4><p>On completion of this degree, you’ll be able to work in roles that span across various major sporting organisations and the global sports industry including:</p><ul><li>Sports Business Analytics</li><li>Performance Analytics.</li></ul> <p>27.3% projected employment growth by 2030.</p> <p>The Business Research Company</p>',
