    course_description = '<h4>Degree overview</h4><p>Build your future in accounting.</p><p>A career in accounting provides opportunities in the current business environment. Businesses are looking for people with superior analytical skills which accounting can provide.</p><p>We equip graduates with the knowledge and skills to succeed in accounting across the globe.</p> <p> <strong> AACSB &amp; EQUIS ? </strong> accredited business school <!-- no link --> </p> <p> <strong> World top 175 ? </strong> for business and economics </p> <h4>Career opportunities</h4><p>Our program is the gateway to internationally recognised memberships.</p><p>A thorough understanding of accounting principles make for a versatile and employable graduate.</p> <p>Knowledge, skills and confidence in accounting are important attributes of senior managers. Accounting skills are transferrable across all industries and are required for financial decision making. The insights you will gain as a graduate of the Master of Professional Accounting (Advanced) will provide you with the knowledge and skills needed to seek employment in careers such as:</p><ul><li>Forensic Accountant</li><li>Internal Auditor</li><li>Ratings Analyst</li><li>Chief Financial Officer</li><li>Financial Advisor.</li></ul><p>The theory and accounting principles you have acquired through the Master of Professional Accounting will equip you for diverse real-world business situations. This knowledge will increase your value and see you fast-track to leadership and career advancement.</p> <p>94.7% employed within four months of graduating.</p> <p>Graduate Outcomes Survey (2022-2024) - Postgraduate Business &amp; Management</p>',
